 "remarks": "Exceptional Opportunity with NO ADDITIONAL FEES - Newer, bright & airy, this 2 bed/2-bath corner apartment features contemporary design, open floor plan, skyline views & a variety of amenities to complement your life! Located on the brim of exciting downtown Stamford in a secure, well managed community, residents will enjoy an open kitchen, fully equipped with granite & stainless, living spaces lined with big windows, a spacious & 2 sparkling full baths with subway tile, in-unit laundry, on-site 24-hour security, reserved garage parking, a well-appointed fitness center and awesome rooftop deck to take in the outdoors and enjoy panoramic cityscape views. Adding to the features is a 5-star energy rating and NO ADDITIONAL FEES!  Interested applicants must complete a Park 215 or Rentspree Application uploaded in supplements. Pets are welcome at Park 215, here are the limits: 1 dog - 35lbs, 2 cats, or 1 dog and 1 cat OK. Park 215 is a no smoking community.",
